YOUR TASK: Complete this task: Implement the full Python solution: read all queries, compute L = isqrt(max(A)); sieve primes up to L; use a bytearray distinct-prime-factor counter incremented once for each multiple of each prime; build sorted list vals = [i*i for i in range(L+1) if cnt[i] == 2]; answer each A with vals[bisect_right(vals, A) - 1]; print all answers with fast I/O.